SUMMARY:Public Media’s Digital Shift: Scaling Audience and Revenue with Indiegraf
URL:http://indiegraf.com/webinars/public-media-audience-revenue-growth
DESCRIPTION:Is your station stuck in transformation paralysis from disconnected legacy tools? Join Allison McIlmoyl and Bridget Thoreson from Indiegraf for a 60-minute information session designed specifically for resource-constrained\, non-profit community radio stations. Secure your spot today to learn how to modernize your digital infrastructure\, scale your audience\, and secure your station's revenue and future -- plus get a detailed overview of a subsidized program that can help qualifying stations significantly save on technology costs.
LOCATION:
END:VEVENT





